abstract: >
  Infrastructure for converting clinical case descriptions into ontology-linked
  clinical state representations. v0.1.0 (Level 0) includes the annotation
  schema, a synthetic example, and validation tooling. Source texts, surface
  forms, spans, and identifiers are NOT redistributed.
